== 2. The cycles in the unit cells, and the cycle through -17
PASS  cycle [0]: cell (1,0), 2^k - 3^s = 1
PASS  cycle [-1]: cell (1,1), 2^k - 3^s = -1
PASS  cycle [1, 2]: cell (2,1), 2^k - 3^s = 1
PASS  cycle [-5, -7, -10]: cell (3,2), 2^k - 3^s = -1
PASS  cycle [-17, -25, -37, -55, -82, -41, -61, -91, -136, -68, -34]: cell (11,7), 2^k - 3^s = -139
PASS  v = n + 1 on the -5 cycle: -4 -> -6 -> -9; (-4)(-9) = (-6)^2 = T_8 = T_(-9) = 36
PASS  in v the odd step is v -> 3v/2 and the even step is v -> (v+1)/2
