== 2c. Why 3: cells with |2^k - q^s| = 1 for odd q
PASS  q = 3 is the only odd multiplier <= 2001 with four unit cells
PASS  two unit cells exactly for q = 2^j +- 1 (q != 3): [5, 7, 9, 15, 17, 31, 33, 63] ... (17 values)
PASS  every other q has one: 982 values

