== 6. The folded pentagon modulo 5 (teaser for the companion page)
PASS  P(T^k(n) = 1 mod 5 | n = 1 mod 5) = (2^k + 2(-1)^k L_k)/(5 * 2^k), k <= 14, by brute force
PASS  charpoly(2 K_5) = x*(x - 2)*(x - 1)*(x**2 + x - 1)
PASS  2 cos 144 deg = -phi, a root of x^2 + x - 1
PASS  5 = 3 + 2 = 3^2 - 2^2

