PASS  81119 dropping classes of level <= 24
PASS  least residues that do not drop at their class level, levels <= 24: [0, 1]
PASS  5x+1: natural shares begin 1/2, 1/8, 1/16, and the first 2^12 triangular numbers carry them exactly
